1102293209,"roundId":"round_1791102227769_lifxklcyl","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790793702136_3gr3lhtj8","characterId":"045464e8-a183-492e-956f-8ed62d7792b2","_id":1416},{"id":1791539461189,"text":"更不该咬你","rawContent":"更不该咬你","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"16:24","timestamp":1791102295545,"roundId":"round_1791102227769_lifxklcyl","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790793702136_3gr3lhtj8","characterId":"045464e8-a183-492e-956f-8ed62d7792b2","_id":1417},{"id":1791539461190,"text":"我以后再也不敢了，你让我往东我绝不往西，你让我干嘛我就干嘛……","rawContent":"我以后再也不敢了，你让我往东我绝不往西，你让我干嘛我就干嘛……","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"16:25","timestamp":1791102316749,"roundId":"round_1791102227769_lifxklcyl","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"isFavorite":true,"userId":"uid_1790793702136_3gr3lhtj8","characterId":"045464e8-a183-492e-956f-8ed62d7792b2","_id":1418},{"id":1791539461191,"text":"他小心翼翼地把手里的甜点盒放在她旁边的桌子上，然后半蹲下身，仰起头看着她，灰蓝色的眼睛里满是讨好和祈求。他伸出双手，轻轻拉住她的一截衣角，像只犯了错怕被主人丢掉的金毛。","rawContent":"他小心翼翼地把手里的甜点盒放在她旁边的桌子上，然后半蹲下身，仰起头看着她，灰蓝色的眼睛里满是讨好和祈求。他伸出双手，轻轻拉住她的一截衣角，像只犯了错怕被主人丢掉的金毛。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"16:25","timestamp":1791102342014,"roundId":"round_1791102227769_lifxklcyl","generatedMode":false,"type":"state","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790793702136_3gr3lhtj8","characterId":"045464e8-a183-492e-956f-8ed62d7792b2","_id":1419},{"id":1791539461192,"text":"我给你买了你喜欢的草莓和蓝莓蛋糕……你吃一口甜甜的，就把刚刚那个讨厌的沈栖迟忘掉好不好？","rawContent":"我给你买了你喜欢的草莓和蓝莓蛋糕……你吃一口甜甜的，就把刚刚那个讨厌的沈栖迟忘掉好不好？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"16:25","timestamp":1791102357997,"roundId":"round_1791102227769_lifxklcyl","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"isFavorite":true,"userId":"uid_1790793702136_3gr3lhtj8","characterId":"045464e8-a183-492e-956f-8ed62d7792b2","_id":1420},{"id":1791539461193,"text":"","rawContent":"","isHtml":false,"sticker":"https://imgbed.heliar.top/i/AMhKDFnWbD_tw6Ne_Screenshot_2026-10-02-07-1